  {
    "uuid": "fc204f96-13cf-580f-93e1-3011f8d04bd5",
    "entry": "玉眼",
    "reading": {
      "primary": "ぎょくがん",
      "alternatives": [],
      "is_heteronym": false
    },
    "grammar": {
      "pos": [
        "名詞"
      ],
      "ctype": null,
      "inflections": null
    },
    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "eyes made of crystal, glass, etc. inserted into the head of a Buddhist statue",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "仏像の玉眼は何百年経っても色褪せていない。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "職人は丹念に玉眼を取り付け、仏像の顔を完成させた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "古い仏像の玉眼からは、かつての信仰の篤さが伝わってくる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "それから買った後の九十五体の観音はどうで焼けてしまうのだから、その玉眼と白毫（眉間に嵌めてある宝玉、水晶で作ったもの）が勿体ない。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "幕末維新懐古談",
                "author": "蠑螺堂百観音の成り行き",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "左方の狛犬玉眼一隻破たり。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "伊沢蘭軒",
                "author": "森鴎外",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "gloss": "beautiful female eyes",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "その女優の玉眼は舞台上で観客を惹きつけた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "彼女の玉眼のような瞳は、深い思いを秘めていた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "詩人は彼女の玉眼を見つめ、美しさに言葉を失った。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      }
    ],
